      },
      "message": "fix(app): a laid cylinder still has no top face after #2758\n\nSince #2758, stock_follow::sim_frame keeps a laid cylinder's turn\ninstead of refusing it, so sketch::stock_face returned the cylinder's\nvertical end face as the profile face. stock_face now refuses by name\n(NO_TOP_FACE) when the frame from sim_frame does not look up.\n\ndocs/agents/mcp-tools.md is written again from the live tool table\n(set_stock axis/angles_deg, fit_stock frame note).\n\nPinned by a_profile_lies_on_a_laid_box_and_a_laid_cylinder_is_refused\nand the_committed_reference_matches_the_live_tool_table.\n\nRefs #2576\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
